title: FirstLoopWisteria
tags:
---

<< if DoesHeKnow("SecondLoop") == true >>
	<<jump SecondLoopWisteria1>>
<<endif>>
<< if DoesHeKnow("WisteriaIntroSeen") >>
	(Enter DR. WISTERIA)
	<< jump FirstLoopWisteriaTree1 >>
<<else>>
	SETTING - The great fountain in NAUKA SQUARE. Flags flutter in the wind. The parade sounds notably closer now. There is a doctor standing by the fountain.
	AT RISE -  THE DOCTOR gives SASHA a quick look up and down at the approach, then turns away again.
	NARRATOR: The id-card on her lapel says “Dr. Wisteria - General Practitioner - Star Hospital”. 
    NARRATOR: There are some dark red stains at the bottom of her coat that imply she may do some more practical medicine than just consulting.
	<<Learn WisteriaIntroSeen>>
	<< Learn WisteriaTarot >>
	<< Learn WisteriaInfoA>> //The local doctor
	<< jump FirstLoopWisteriaTree1 >>
<<endif>>

===

title: FirstLoopWisteriaTree1
---
-> “Hello.”
	SASHA: "Hello."
-> "Do you know where Dmitriy Yıldız is?"
	SASHA: "Do you know where Dmitriy Yıldız is?"
<< if $FirstLoopWisteriaOptionsPicked == 0 >>
    DR. WISTERIA: (stares at you)
    << set $FirstLoopWisteriaOptionsPicked = 1 >>
    << jump FirstLoopWisteriaTree1 >>
<< else >>		
    DR. DR. WISTERIA: “Are you hurt, wounded, or dying?”
    -> “...No?”
		SASHA: "...No?"
    -> “Not physically.”
		SASHA: "Not physically."
    DR. WISTERIA: “Then we have nothing to talk about. You can leave now.”
    NARRATOR: You won’t get any kinder words from her than this. Perhaps you can come back to her sometime if you have something that you specifically need from her.
<< endif >>












